THIRD-PARTY ALGORITHMS

This software implements techniques based on published academic work:

  - Circular scribble art: Chiu et al., "Stylized Image Triangulation", 2015
  - TSP-style tour: Oskay, Evil Mad Scientist Laboratories, 2017
  - Squiggly scan lines: Wygonik, "SquiggleDraw", Evil Mad Scientist Labs
  - Fast Marching Method: Sethian, J.A., "A Fast Marching Level Set Method
    for Monotonically Advancing Fronts", PNAS, 93(4), 1996

Credit and gratitude to the authors of all referenced works.

